content.text:
Need ensure `WeddingGuest` new with relation user? Fine. `render` date: event date cast maybe Carbon. In demo event `event_date` cast date. Good.

Now routes. Root platform landing. `routes/web.php` rewrite with root and include wedding. Need auth middleware redirect. Let's create `routes/wedding.php` with all routes.

Route structure:
```
Route::prefix('wedding')->name('wedding.')->group(function () {
   // public
   Route::get('/', LandingController@index)->name('home');
   Route::get('/templates', CatalogController@index)->name('templates.index');
   Route::get('/templates/{slug}', CatalogController@show)->name('templates.show');
   Route::get('/templates/{slug}/preview', CatalogController@preview)->name('templates.preview');
   Route::get('/templates/{slug}/use', CatalogController@use)->name('templates.use'); // auth? if guest, redirect login
   Route::get('/paket', PackagePageController)->name('packages');
   // auth guest
   Route::middleware('guest')->group...
   Route::post('/logout'...)
   // public invitation POST rsvp/wish and GET show at end
   Route::post('/{slug}/rsvp', ...)->name('rsvp.store')->where(...)
   ...
   // customer...
   // admin...
   // public GET last
   Route::get('/{slug}', PublicInvitationController@show)->where('slug',...)->name('invitation.show');
});
```
Order matters: `/templates/{slug}/preview` before `/{slug}`. Admin/customer routes before catch-all. `/wedding/{slug}` may match `/wedding/templates` but earlier templates route wins. `/wedding/paket` earlier. Reserved `login` etc earlier.

For `templates.use`: if guest, auth middleware? We can handle in controller and redirect to login with `intended`. Route outside auth. Fine.

Auth logout route.

Customer group middleware auth, role customer:
- dashboard
- invitations resource subset
- `invitations/{wedding}/edit`, update, preview, publish, duplicate, destroy.
- `guests` with optional wedding; methods.
- `guests/import`, `guests/export`, `guests/{guest}/link`, `guests/{guest}/wa`
- rsvp index, wishes index/hide/approve/delete, broadcast.
- account, langganan, pembayaran store.

Admin group auth role super_admin:
- dashboard, customers, customers/{user}, templates, templates/{template}/toggle, weddings, packages, packages/{package}, payments, payments/{payment}/confirm/reject, settings.

Need avoid route model binding of Wedding by slug? Use id. Public manual.

For preview editor route:
`GET /wedding/invitations/{wedding}/preview` name `invitations.preview` (auth customer). Use controller with template. Public template preview: `/wedding/preview/{slug}` maybe route. We'll use `/wedding/templates/{slug}/preview`. Public invitation `/{slug}`.

Important: `/wedding/templates/{slug}` can catch `/wedding/templates/melati/preview`? specific route first.

Throttle middleware rate limit.

Let's write routes.

