Now let me apply the fix to `create.blade.php`.

First the input + hint. Let me edit lines 86-90.

Current:
```html
                        <input type="text" name="slug" x-model="slug" @input="slug = slugify(slug)" required minlength="3" maxlength="60" placeholder="rangga-ayu"
